# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Netherian now have -25% Attack Speed instead of -25% Block Breaking Speed, as described in the race info
- Orebringer gravity changed to +20%, Oakhearted jump strength to +50% and Palehearted jump strength to +25%, as described in the race info
- Atlantic Shot, Breeze Shot and Void Shot now shoot 5 projectiles, as described in the scroll info
- Each race now starts with its own default ability hotkey (Aetherian: Jump, Netherian & Turtlekin: Sprint, all others: Crouch), still changeable in the Player Settings
- Villager Hats can now rarely be bartered from Descendants
- Decoy scrolls can now be obtained from Enchanting Tables

## Fixes:
- Scout and Survivor class abilities not working
- Crown of Roots not working for Endlings
- Netherian and Oakhearted Treasures containing each other's loot
- Moonshroud Shelters and Treasures generating in Oakhearted biomes
- Netherite Hatchet and Netherite Throwing Knife sharing the same recipe
- Stormcall scroll info not mentioning its limit of 5 targets
- Back buttons in menus not showing their label
